      "reason": "Lint version 2 (re-review of the lint fixes): fenced code and the bodies of data tags are no longer checked for capitals, placeholders or contradictions; date and time format strings such as YYYY-MM-DD are data; every sentence of a rule-section line counts."
    }
  ],
